---
config:
  theme: base
  fontFamily: "Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"
  sequence:
    actorMargin: 24
    width: 130
    diagramMarginX: 10
    boxMargin: 12
    boxTextMargin: 8
    messageMargin: 40
    noteMargin: 22
    labelBoxWidth: 56
    labelBoxHeight: 28
    messageFontSize: 16
    actorFontSize: 16
    noteFontSize: 15
    wrap: false
  themeVariables:
    textColor: "#8b5cf6"
    actorBkg: "#ede9fe"
    actorBorder: "#7c3aed"
    actorTextColor: "#4c1d95"
    actorLineColor: "#a78bfa"
    signalColor: "#8b949e"
    signalTextColor: "#6e7781"
    labelBoxBkgColor: "#ccfbf1"
    labelBoxBorderColor: "#0d9488"
    labelTextColor: "#134e4a"
    loopTextColor: "#0d9488"
    noteBkgColor: "#fef3c7"
    noteBorderColor: "#d97706"
    noteTextColor: "#78350f"
    activationBkgColor: "#c4b5fd"
    activationBorderColor: "#7c3aed"
    mainBkg: "#ede9fe"
    nodeBorder: "#7c3aed"
    secondaryColor: "#ede9fe"
    secondaryBorderColor: "#7c3aed"
    secondaryTextColor: "#4c1d95"
    tertiaryColor: "#ede9fe"
    tertiaryBorderColor: "#7c3aed"
    tertiaryTextColor: "#4c1d95"
  themeCSS: >
    svg, .label, .nodeLabel, .edgeLabel, foreignObject div { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; }
    .actor { filter: drop-shadow(0 3px 6px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.18)); }
    rect.actor { rx: 12px; ry: 12px; }
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client<br/>ros2 param set
    participant Node as CameraNode<br/>executor thread
    participant Driver as CameraDriver<br/>its own thread
    participant Camera

    Client ->> Node: set_parameters<br/>iso = 800
    Note over Node: rclcpp holds the<br/>parameters' lock
    Node ->> Driver: run(applySetting)
    Note over Driver: the task waits for<br/>the next turn of the loop
    Driver ->> Camera: getChoices(iso)
    Camera -->> Driver: Auto, 100, ... 6400
    Note over Driver: matchChoice()
    Driver ->> Camera: setSetting(iso, 800)
    Driver -->> Node: done, or a CameraError
    Note over Node: remembers the value<br/>in wanted_settings_
    Node -->> Client: successful, or the reason<br/>with the choices
